Training core. The joystick task, reward library, domain randomization
and training wrappers descend from w01-tek
(https://github.com/machinekind/w01-tek, Apache-2.0), which in turn ports
them from Google DeepMind's MuJoCo Playground
(https://github.com/google-deepmind/mujoco_playground, Apache-2.0). The
PPO hyper-parameters and network sizes start from Playground's tuned Go1
configuration.

